error[E0277]: `f64` has no CDDL rule (see `dcbor::cddl`, "What has a rule")
  --> tests/ui/fail/cddl_float_field.rs:10:14
   |
10 |     celsius: f64,
   |              ^^^ no CDDL rule for `f64`
   |
   = help: the trait `Cddl` is not implemented for `f64`
   = note: floating-point types, `MinimalBigInt`, `Date` and hash sets accept sets no CDDL type denotes; a rule for `StabilizedText` would have no oracle independent of its decoder's tables (see `dcbor::cddl`)
   = help: the following other types implement trait `Cddl`:
             i16
             i32
             i64
             i8
             u16
             u32
             u64
             u8
             usize
